WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:10.500
Revised code with a perception watchdog. The aircraft takes off.

00:10.500 --> 00:13.000
Depth stream deliberately cut.

00:13.000 --> 00:23.000
Perception loss detected. The aircraft holds position.

00:23.000 --> 00:24.500
Depth bridge restarted. Perception returns.

00:24.500 --> 00:41.500
The planner resumes obstacle avoidance and the aircraft continues to its goal.

00:41.500 --> 00:44.600
Goal reached. Event times are approximate.
